{"title":"让 Vibe Coding 表达更 准确","html":"<main><div class=\"skill-page\"><div class=\"skill-detail\"><nav class=\"detail-breadcrumb skill-breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"面包屑\"><button class=\"breadcrumb-link\" type=\"button\">术语图鉴</button><span class=\"breadcrumb-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">›</span><span class=\"breadcrumb-current\" aria-current=\"page\">VibeHub Skill</span></nav><section class=\"skill-intro\"><div class=\"skill-intro-copy\"><div class=\"skill-label\">VibeHub Skill</div><h1><span class=\"skill-hero-context\">让 Vibe Coding</span><strong>表达更<span class=\"skill-hero-accent\">准确</span></strong></h1><p>每当你的描述可能产生歧义，VibeHub 都会找出更恰当的技术术语，把需求改成可以直接发给 Agent 的准确表达，并附上通俗解释和链接。</p><div class=\"skill-facts\"><div class=\"skill-fact\"><b>360</b><span>个可视化术语</span></div><div class=\"skill-fact\"><b>2</b><span>个核心功能</span></div><div class=\"skill-fact\"><i class=\"ti ti-message\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span>一句话即可开始</span></div></div></div><section class=\"skill-browser-demo\" aria-label=\"VibeHub Skill 真实对话演示\"><div class=\"skill-browser-chrome\"><span class=\"skill-browser-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"skill-browser-back\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"ti ti-arrow-left\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></span><div class=\"skill-browser-address\"><i class=\"ti ti-lock\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span>agent.local/project</span></div><span class=\"skill-browser-more\" aria-hidden=\"true\">•••</span></div><div class=\"skill-browser-tab\"><i class=\"ti ti-message-circle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span>Agent 对话</span></div><div class=\"skill-browser-viewport\" aria-live=\"polite\"><div class=\"skill-browser-thread\"><div class=\"skill-browser-user\"><span>鼠标放到这个按钮上时，显示一个小提示，告诉用户它是做什么的。</span></div><div class=\"skill-browser-agent\"><div class=\"skill-browser-agent-head\"><i class=\"ti ti-sparkles\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><strong>Agent</strong><span><i class=\"ti ti-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>已完成</span></div><div class=\"skill-browser-agent-bubble\"><p>已经加好了：鼠标悬停或键盘聚焦时，会显示“下载”。这种短提示通常叫 <button type=\"button\" class=\"skill-browser-term-trigger\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"skill-tooltip-preview\">Tooltip（文字提示）</button>。</p></div><small><i class=\"ti ti-pointer\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>点击术语，原地查看通俗解释</small></div></div></div></section></section><section class=\"skill-install\" id=\"skill-install\" aria-labelledby=\"install-title\"><div class=\"skill-install-copy\"><small>一分钟安装</small><h2 id=\"install-title\">复制这段话，发给你的 Agent</h2><p>Agent 会打开 GitHub 仓库并完成安装。</p></div><div class=\"skill-install-prompt\"><code><a href=\"https://github.com/ans-org/ans-vibehub-skills\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://github.com/ans-org/ans-vibehub-skills</a><span>帮我安装这个仓库里的 skills/vibehub Skill。</span></code><button type=\"button\" class=\"skill-copy\" aria-label=\"复制安装指令\"><span class=\"skill-copy-state skill-copy-idle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"ti ti-copy\"></i><span>复制安装指令</span></span><span class=\"skill-copy-state skill-copy-success\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"ti ti-check\"></i><span>已复制</span></span></button></div></section><section class=\"skill-block\" aria-labelledby=\"rewrite-title\"><div class=\"skill-block-title\"><span>功能一 · 规范表达</span><h2 id=\"rewrite-title\">把模糊描述改成可以直接发送的需求</h2><p>Skill 会保留你的原意，只补上真正有用的术语，不擅自增加框架、参数或实现方案。</p></div><div class=\"skill-rewrite-visual\"><div class=\"skill-rewrite-before\"><span>你的原话</span><p>这个按钮鼠标放上去变个色，点下去也要有一下反馈。</p></div><i class=\"ti ti-arrow-down skill-rewrite-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><div class=\"skill-rewrite-after\"><header><span>可以直接对 Agent 说</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"skill-copy\" aria-label=\"复制规范后的表达\"><span class=\"skill-copy-state skill-copy-idle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"ti ti-copy\"></i><span>复制规范后的表达</span></span><span class=\"skill-copy-state skill-copy-success\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"ti ti-check\"></i><span>已复制</span></span></button></header><p>为按钮补充 <a class=\"skill-term-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/hover?lang=zh\">Hover</a> 状态和 <a class=\"skill-term-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/active?lang=zh\">Active</a> 状态，并使用 <a class=\"skill-term-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/transition?lang=zh\">Transition</a> 让状态变化更自然。</p></div></div></section><section class=\"skill-block\" aria-labelledby=\"suggest-title\"><div class=\"skill-block-title\"><span>功能二 · 主动提示</span><h2 id=\"suggest-title\">不用先问“这叫什么”</h2><p>只要你的描述存在歧义或缺少恰当名词，Skill 就会主动指出最相关的 1–3 个术语，并把解释放在当前场景里，不需要等你追问。</p></div><div class=\"skill-suggest-visual\"><div class=\"skill-dialogue-user\"><small>你说</small><p>这个设置我想改了就马上生效，不想再点一次保存。</p></div><div class=\"skill-dialogue-agent\"><header><i class=\"ti ti-sparkles\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><small>VibeHub 提示</small></header><p>这种场景通常适合 <a class=\"skill-term-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/switch?lang=zh\">Switch</a>：它适合只有开和关两种状态、修改后立即生效的设置。如果用户需要先调整多项内容再统一确认，就不应该这样设计。</p></div><ul class=\"skill-suggest-rules\"><li><i class=\"ti ti-link\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>术语第一次出现时直接链接到 VibeHub</li><li><i class=\"ti ti-message-circle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>解释紧跟当前任务，不讲百科式定义</li><li><i class=\"ti ti-filter\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>每次最多提示 3 个真正相关的术语</li></ul></div></section></div></div></main>","sourceUrl":"https://vibe-hub.org/vibehub-skill"}